,{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\nIII（1）×1（1分），17（1分）（16.9、17.0、17.1都给分，其余不给分）；\n(2) 发生了断电自感现象 (2 分)\n（出现 “自感”、“线圈阻碍电流变化”、“电磁感应”、“感应电流” 也给 2 分）\n强（1 分）\n(3) OFF 挡或交流电压最高挡（1 分）（漏写“挡”字，也给分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--wenzhou-ermo-2604-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--wenzhou-ermo-2604","source_question_id":"wenzhou-ermo-2604-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f4f39dc140204bd4a9c6870d745836eaccc95e98e13043999862b797404a33d7","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. （8分）有一火灾报警装置，其原理如图1所示，当活塞触及卡柱时，触发报警，致使闪烁灯闪烁、警报器鸣笛。导热性能良好的容器安装在天花板上，卡柱到容器上端距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 。横截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S"},{"type":"text","value":" 、质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的活塞（厚度不计）密封一定质量的理想气体，活塞能沿容器无摩擦滑动。未发生火灾时，环境温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，活塞与卡柱的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" ；发生火灾时，容器内温度缓慢上升到 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，从 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 至 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 过程中容器中气体内能增加了9.6J。已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"S = 1.0\\times 10^{-4}\\mathrm{m}^2"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.2\\mathrm{kg}, T_{1} = 300\\mathrm{K}, T_{2} = 600\\mathrm{K}, L = 0.15\\mathrm{m}, d = 0.05\\mathrm{m}, p_0 = 1.0\\times 10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）求未发生火灾时容器内的压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）在图 2 中画出从 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 至 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 过程中容器内气体的 V-T 图像；\n（3）求从 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 至 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 过程中，气体吸收的热量。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0893948368cee793bb5000444d9a57cdce79d687eb8409f7ae8ff8a572f8f478.png","width":322,"height":282,"width_mm":37.687,"row_