.621,"row_group":"wenzhou-ermo-2604-q16-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e7155d08d1719b2a31e308d43c5928f7511bd41712ce97e6861c06d06d36eab6.png","width":372,"height":238,"width_mm":48.001,"row_group":"wenzhou-ermo-2604-q16-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）\n（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"D_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"侧面电势比"},{"type":"math","value":"D_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"侧面电势高（或"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi_{D1} > \\varphi_{D2}"},{"type":"text","value":"）（2分）\n（2） ①稳定时, 对其中一个自由电子:"},{"type":"math","value":"e \\frac{U_H}{a} = evB"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) (写成"},{"type":"math","value":"eE = evB"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"U_H = Bav"},{"type":"text","value":"也得 1 分) 又有:"},{"type":"math","value":"I = nevad"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) 可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"U_H = \\frac{IB}{ned}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) 结合题意:"},{"type":"math","value":"U_H = k \\frac{IB}{d}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"k = \\frac{1}{ne}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n（本小题共4分，全程"},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":"写成"},{"type":"math","value":"q"},{"type":"text","value":"，扣1分，得3分）\n（3）由图像："},{"type":"math","value":"T=N_{0}t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n所以，车辆速度："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\frac{2\\pi r}{T}=\\frac{2\\pi r}{N_{0}t_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（"},{"type":"math","value":"N_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"写成 N 或者代入数字 “9”，本小题扣 1 分）\n（4）磁强计、霍尔调速器、测微小位移、控制笔记本电脑开机等\n（只要合理，写出一种应用就给分）（2分）\n（说明：写“电磁流量计”、“速度选择器”、“磁流体发电机”不给分。）\n注：以上各步用其他方法解题的，只要合理，得同样的分。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--wenzhou-ermo-2604-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--wenzhou-ermo-2604","source_question_id":"wenzhou-ermo-2604-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"263a18eb1a5955aaaaffe1ffe27bc3defdc2ecb033acad5d933a7d2c57009d7f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （12分）医院气动传输系统用于医用物品传送，可以实现跨楼层、跨区域高效传输。如图所示为气动传输装置模型管道ABCD，其中AB竖直、高度H=2m，BC是半径R=1m的四分之一圆弧管道（R远大于管道内径），CD水平、长度x=8.5m。A处放置一质量m=1kg的传输瓶甲，启动风机，利用气压差给甲施加一大小恒为F=20N沿管道方向的气动推力，AB和CD均光滑，甲经BC过程克服阻力做功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W_{f}=(10\\pi-20)\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，传输瓶可视为质点，求：\n（1）传输瓶甲经圆弧管道 B 点时，管道对其压力大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n(2) 传输瓶甲到达 C 点时的速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）若传输瓶甲进入 CD 管道后，某时刻调整气压差，甲获得向左的加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"a_{1}=\\frac{20}{3}m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。要使甲到 D 点速度恰好为零，求甲在运动过程中的最大速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（4）现有质量 M=2kg 的传输瓶乙锁在管道 CD 上的 E 点（E 点未标出），CE 长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}=1m"},{"type":"text","value":" 。甲运动至 E 点瞬间解锁乙，甲、乙发生弹性碰撞。碰撞前后甲受气动推力一直为 F=20N，碰后乙始终具有向左的加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"a_{2}=\\frac{20}{3}m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。则在乙速度第一次减为零之前，甲、乙是否会再次发生碰撞？若会，求再次碰撞的位置到 C 点的距离。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/06a789e441121fd1a4be6b0c0ed2d77f806ed19de1487d565f0a97e3cedac85e.png","width":804,"height":302,"width_mm":94.422,"row_group":"wenzhou-ermo-2604-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数：未特殊说明，重力加速度 g 均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）\n（1）甲从"},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"到"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"(F - mg)H = \\frac{1}{2} mv_B^2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）（用牛顿第二定律求解，也给1分）甲经"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"点处时："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{N}} = m\\frac{v_{B}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）解得："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{N}} = 40\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（结果正确，公式中 R 写成了 r，不扣分）\n（2）甲从"},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"到"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":"由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"F(H + \\frac{\\pi R}{2}) - mg(H + R) - W_{\\mathrm{f}} = \\frac{1}{2} mv_{C}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）（或者从"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"到"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":"由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"F\\cdot \\frac{\\pi R}{2} -mgR - W_{\\mathrm{f}} = \\frac{1}{2} mv_{C}^{2} - \\frac{1}{2} mv_{B}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"也可以）\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C} = 2\\sqrt{15}\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）由分析可知：\n加速："},{"type":"math","value":"a_{0}=\\frac{F}{m}=20m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n减速："},{"type":"math","value":"a_{1}=\\frac{20}{3}m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"由："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{m}^{2}-v_{C}^{2}}{2a_{0}}+\\frac{v_{m}^{2}}{2a_{1}}=x"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=10m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（用其他方法，比如图像法得出结果，也给分）\n(4) 甲由 C 运动至 E:"},{"type":"math","value":"Fx_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{E}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{C}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E}=10m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)（列出式子就得 1 分）\n甲乙碰撞，以向右为正方向，有"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{E}=mv_{\\text{甲}}+Mv_{\\text{乙}}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{E}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{\\text{甲}}^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}Mv_{\\text{乙}}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{甲}}=-\\frac{10}{3}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{乙}}=\\frac{20}{3}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)（两个速度都对，或者两条公式都对，得1分）\n甲以"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{0}=20m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的加速度向左匀减速至零后（未进入圆弧管道），再继续向右匀加速运动。\n乙以"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{2}=\\frac{20}{3}m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的加速度向右匀减速运动。\n对甲："},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=v_{\\text{甲}}t+\\frac{1}{2}a_{0}t^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"对乙："},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}=v_{\\text{乙}}t-\\frac{1}{2}a_{2}t^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"若会二次碰撞，则"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=x_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{3}{4}s"},{"type":"text","value":"，小于 1s，合理。（1分）（写出会二次碰撞就得1分）\n代入 t，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}=x_{2}=3.125m"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{25}{8}m"},{"type":"text","value":"所以，二次碰撞点离 C 点 4.125m 或"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{33}{8}m"},{"type":"text","value":"。 (1分)\n注：以上各步用其他方法解题的，只要合理，得同样的分。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--wenzhou-ermo-2604-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--wenzhou-ermo-2604","source_question_id":"wenzhou-ermo-2604-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"39bfd07e3fe1bcf479fb668aa5831781befce925d0bfda17a8ba976da0ce1c18","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （13分）利用质子照相术，可以分析强电流产生的磁场及质子的动能。如图1所示， "},{"type":"math","value":"PQ"},{"type":"text","value":" 是沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴放置、长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的细电流丝，分别过 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 的I、II平面均与 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴垂直。当电流丝中通以强电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，会在I、II两个平面之间激发环形磁场，磁场中某点磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = k\\frac{I}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" 为已知常数， "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" 为该点到 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的距离。II平面右侧距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处，垂直 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴放置探测胶片，胶片由许多RCF膜叠合而成，不同动能的质子会打在不同深度的膜上。现有大量的高能质子从I平面、沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向射入磁场空间，经偏转，最终打在探测胶片上。实验发现：每张RCF膜片中心，都会出现一个圆形暗斑（即无质子区），而在暗斑边缘出现一圈特别明亮的亮环，如图2所示。已知质子的质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"q"},{"type":"text","value":" ；高能质子在磁场区运动时间极短，速度方向偏转角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 很小，有 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta \\approx \\tan \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" ，且认为单个质子在磁场中运动所经之处磁感应强度处处相同；实验环境为真空，不考虑质子重力及质子间相互作用。\n（1）判断电流丝 "},{"type":"math","value":"PQ"},{"type":"text","value":" 中强电流的方向；\n（2）求动能为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、离 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" 入射的质子，在磁场中偏转角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 的正弦值；\n（3）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"m=1.67\\times10^{-27}kg"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"q=1.6\\times10^{-19}C"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"k=1.0\\times10^{-7}T\\cdot m/A"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"I=1.0\\times10^{5}A"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}=\\sqrt{3.34}\\,\\mathrm{mm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2}=22.5mm"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求对应质子动能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{0}=0.1MeV"},{"type":"text","value":" 的膜片上，圆形暗斑的直径 D；\n（4）某次实验中，从RCF膜堆中提取两张不同深度的膜片（如图3所示）。测得膜片a中暗斑直径 "},{"type":"math","value":"D_{a}=6.0mm"},{"type":"text","value":" ，膜片b中暗斑直径 "},{"type":"math","value":"D_{b}=4.0mm"},{"type":"text","value":" ，膜片a对应的质子动能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{a}=1.6MeV"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求膜片b对应的质子动能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6d67015ac781ef929fc2787fe9dcd1789179de71be63972a25a7f412223b3185.png","width":658,"height":282,"width_mm":77.171,"row_group":"wenzhou-ermo-2604-q18-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/53e6b7879c6b14aa94048574c41f933124082ca1791ce0527a9ebafc5403ce5a.png","width":274,"height":275,"width_mm":32.139,"row_group":"wenzhou-ermo-2604-q18-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9749396ba395176c63be031198ae9a17573d65bd310edcbb30f2467e631bbbc7.png","width":232,"height":275,"width_mm":27.237,"row_group":"wenzhou-ermo-2604-q18-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）\n（1）强电流方向：从 Q 到 P（"},{"type":"math","value":"Q \\rightarrow P"},{"type":"text","value":"、“向左”、“x 轴负方向”均得分）（2分）\n(2) 距"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"轴"},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":"处, 磁感应强度"},{"type":"math","value":"B = k \\frac{I}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":", 对质子, 由牛顿第二定律:"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB = m \\frac{v^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) (写"},{"type":"math","value":"R = \\frac{mv}{qB}"},{"type":"text","value":"也得 1 分) 又有:"},{"type":"math","value":"E_k = \\frac{1}{2} mv^2"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) 可得:"},{"type":"math","value":"R = \\frac{r\\sqrt{2mE_k}}{qkI}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分) (R结果写对, 直接得3分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta = \\frac {L _ {1}}{R} = \\frac {q k I L _ {1}}{r \\sqrt {2 m E _ {k}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n（本小题 q 写成了 e，不扣分）；（用类平抛模型处理，不给分）。\n（3）由于在磁场中偏移量及偏转角均很小，打到探测板上距"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"轴距离："},{"type":"math","value":"Y = r + L _ {2} \\tan \\theta = r + L _ {2} \\sin \\theta = r + \\frac {q k I L _ {1} L _ {2}}{r \\sqrt {2 m E _ {k}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n（写成"},{"type":"math","value":"Y = r + R(1 - \\cos \\theta) + L_{2}\\tan \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"，也给1分）\n由基本不等式，当"},{"type":"math","value":"r = \\frac{qkIL_1L_2}{r\\sqrt{2mE_k}}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，即"},{"type":"math","value":"r = \\sqrt{\\frac{qkIL_1L_2}{\\sqrt{2mE_k}}}"},{"type":"math","value":"Y _ {\\min} = 2 \\sqrt {\\frac {q k I L _ {1} L _ {2}}{\\sqrt {2 m E _ {k}}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"D = 2 Y _ {\\min} = 4 \\sqrt {\\frac {q k I L _ {1} L _ {2}}{\\sqrt {2 m E _ {k}}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n代入数据可得："},{"type":"math","value":"D = 12\\mathrm{mm}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(写成约等于 12mm 也给分)\n（本小题"},{"type":"math","value":"q"},{"type":"text","value":"写成了"},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":"，不扣分）\n（4）由"},{"type":"math","value":"D=2Y_{\\min}=4\\sqrt{\\frac{qkIL_{1}L_{2}}{\\sqrt{2mE_{k}}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"D\\propto\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[4]{E_{k}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{b}=\\left(\\frac{6}{4}\\right)^{4}E_{a}=8.1\\,\\mathrm{MeV}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n(本小题 q 写成了 e，不扣分)\n注：以上各步用其他方法解题的，只要合理，得同样的分。"}]}}]}
